<title>USA: Starwood raises dividend, sets stock split.</title>
<headline>Starwood raises dividend, sets stock split.</headline>
<dateline>PHOENIX, Ariz. 1996-12-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Starwood Lodging Trust, whose shares are paired with Starwood Lodging Corp, said it increased its quarterly dividend to $0.59 per share from $0.49.</p>
<p>The company also set a 3-for-2 stock split in the form of a 50 percent stock dividend.</p>
<p>Both dividends will be payable January 27, 1997 to shareholders of record December 30, 1996.</p>
